Contribute to a sustainable future - join us as a Warehouse employee!
To expand our team, we are looking for an AllRound Warehouse employee who enjoys working on keeping the operations running smoothly. 
Your future employerAt our client, they specialize in complete solar energy solutions. From their locations in Oud Gastel and Nieuwkuijk, they deliver high-quality installations of solar panels, energy storage systems, and related electrical work. With years of technical expertise, they help build a more sustainable future every single day.
About the jobAs an Allround Warehouse Employee, you will play a key role in keeping the operations running smoothly. You will be responsible for organizing the warehouse, managing stock, preparing materials, and supporting our installation teams with the right equipment at the right time.
 What You Will Do
  - Manage daily warehouse operations;
 - Monitor and maintain inventory levels;
 - Issue materials to colleagues and installation teams;
 - Prepare and organize materials for projects;
 - Process incoming goods and deliveries;
 - Maintain a clean, safe, and organized warehouse;
 - Handle purchasing orders and stock replenishment.

Who are you - Technical understanding with a hands-on mentality;
 - Strong sense of responsibility and accuracy;
 - Valid driver's license B + BE;
 - Commitment to safe and tidy working practices;
 - Good command of English.

